Host-run unit tests for the TPS25751 library.

Run them with:

    pio test -e native

Layout:

    support/native/   Arduino API stubs (Stream/Serial/Wire/F()/millis()) that
                      let the library sources compile and run on the host, and
                      the fakes the suites drive. Not a test suite.
    test_native/      Unity test suites, one directory per register class.
                      test_TPS25751Status is the seed/reference suite.

See docs/engineering/TESTING.md for the full testing strategy, required test
cases per register class, and how to add a new suite.
